{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14737","headline":"送申屠正字往湖南迎亲兼谒赵和州因呈上侍郎使君幷戏简前历阳李明府 · 卢纶","name":"送申屠正字往湖南迎亲兼谒赵和州因呈上侍郎使君幷戏简前历阳李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓月朣朦映水关，水边因到历阳山。\n千艘财货朱桥下，一曲闾阎青荻间。\n坦腹定逢潘令醉，上楼应伴庾公闲。\n欢余若问南行计，知念天涯负米还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}